<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $.50 lower than Wednesday's close.Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3  230-260 lbs    58.00-60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  260-270 lbs    57.00-58.00</p>
<p>	  270-280 lbs    56.00-57.00</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs    41.00-46.00</p>
<p>	 over 500 lbs    50.00-53.00</p>
</text>
